@startuml "Bridge - Notifications (Solution) - Object Diagram"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
title The objects at run time — the two axes meet in one reference


object "urgent : UrgentNotification" as u
object "digest : DigestNotification" as dg
object "simple : SimpleNotification" as s

object "sms : SmsChannel" as sms
object "email : EmailChannel" as email

u --> sms : channel
dg --> email : channel
s --> email : channel

note right of sms
  maxBodyLength = 160
  supportsSubject = false
end note

note right of email
  maxBodyLength = 10000
  supportsSubject = true
end note

note as N1
  Three notifications, two channels, and <b>one shared email object</b>
  serving two of them (GoF implementation issue 3).

  `urgent.setChannel(email)` moves the top one across at any moment —
  the notification it is does not change, only how it goes out.
end note

@enduml
